   "en": "Ages ago, long before the events of Nine Sols, two Solarians forever altered the course of Penglai’s history. One, a visionary Fangshi. The other, a king among kings. Bound by fate, torn by belief—their unlikely bond would spiral into a clash of destiny.\n\nUncover the hidden past. Witness the origin of the Nine Sols saga!"
